{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やほ！\nいこまだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の夜風呂あがったらね\n鼻から血が！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうっ！\n鼻血が！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがさ〜\nすごいのよ！\n止まらないのよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次々とてっしゅ（ティッシュ）を真っ赤に染めていったのよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"量多すぎて喉の方まで垂れてきたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうパニック！パニック！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも気をつけてくださいね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/12/0628690/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！"}],"source":"archive"}